# American Kennel Club (AKC)

> Structured index of key AKC resources for LLM retrieval and navigation.

---

## Core Website

* [AKC Home](https://www.akc.org/) - Official AKC homepage covering dog breeds, registration, events, training, health resources, and responsible dog ownership.

