## About AKC

* [About AKC](https://www.akc.org/about/) - Learn about the American Kennel Club's mission, history, governance, programs, and organizational resources.

---

## Dog Breeds

* [Dog Breeds](https://www.akc.org/dog-breeds/) - Browse all AKC-recognized dog breeds, breed groups, characteristics, temperament information, and ownership guidance.

